meta {
  name: Posts - List
  type: http
  seq: 32
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of a discussion space>/posts?limit=10&offset=0
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Posts of a discussion space: pinned first, then the newest. Offset pagination (ADR 0011): metadata.pagination has limit, offset, previousOffset, nextOffset, currentPage, pageCount, totalCount. Get a space cuid with Space Groups - List (the seeded "Announcements" space is a discussion space).
}
